OL,3,GNEWSABid launched for 410 new homes
OL,4,Anear motorway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid has been launched to build 410
OL,7,Fnew homes near a motorway.
OL,9,FMac Mic Strategic Land wants to build
OL,10,Fthe new estate on land between the A38
OL,11,FBristol Road, Bridgwater, and Pawlett
OL,12,FRoad by the M5.
OL,14,FThe land promoter has submitted
OL,15,Fproposals for the homes and a
OL,16,Fcommercial unit to Somerset Council,
OL,17,Fand a decision is expected by summer
OL,18,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
