OL,3,GNEWSABid launched for 410 new homes
OL,4,Anear motorway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Edge Urban Design,
OL,7,Fwhich is representing the applicant,
OL,8,Fsaid the land "presents an opportunity
OL,9,Fto support Somerset Council in meeting
OL,10,Ffuture housing needs".
